   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Being able to do something",
     "texto": [
      "Add **-(y)abilir/-ebilir** to the verb stem and then the personal ending: **gidebilirim** = I can go, **gidebilir misin?** = can you go?",
      "The vowel of the ending depends on vowel harmony. In everyday use, **-abilir miyim?** is also used to ask permission: «can I…?»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Transport",
     "texto": [
      "**Otobüs** = bus; **metro** = metro; **tren** = train; **taksi** = taxi. **İle** means «with» or «by» and goes after the noun: **otobüsle** = by bus.",
      "**Bilet** = ticket; **durak** = stop. **Saat kaçta?** asks at what time."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
